// Startup: the home menu shows at once, nothing is prewarmed in the menu (no shader warm, no merge, no upload warm).
// Gioca / Riprova (first match, or first after a quality change): the loop is held behind the loader while it
//   (0) merges the static map, (1) compiles every program (world, every zombie type, every weapon, shadows),
//   (2) uploads EVERY mesh/texture of the whole map + zombie pool + viewmodels (UP424 pass), (3) draws real warm frames
